Prompt caching fundamentals
Model prompts often contain repetitive content, like system prompts and common instructions. OpenAI routes API requests to servers that recently processed the same prompt, making it faster and less expensive to reuse an exact prompt prefix than to process it from scratch. Prompt Caching works automatically for eligible requests, with no code changes required. It is enabled for all recent models,
